sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Admin / feed
  participant C as Catalogue svc
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Redis Stream
  participant X as Indexer
  participant E as Embedding
  participant Q as Qdrant
  participant R as Retrieval (BM25)
  A->>C: POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE /products
  C->>C: validate (Pydantic) · enrich attributes from text
  C->>P: BEGIN · upsert row (version+1) · INSERT outbox event · COMMIT
  C-->>A: 201/200 (write ack ~12 ms)
  loop outbox relay (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    C->>S: XADD catalogue.events · INCR catalogue_version (invalidates search cache)
  end
  par fan-out
    S->>X: XREADGROUP indexer (batch max 64)
    X->>E: e5 passage vectors + CLIP image vectors (cached by image hash, missing image => text-only)
    X->>Q: upsert / delete points (wait=true)
    X->>S: XACK
  and
    S->>R: XREADGROUP retrieval-<replica>
    R->>R: BM25 postings delta (version-checked, idempotent)
  end
  Note over A,R: measured time-to-searchable ~0.2 s lexical / 0.25 s dense (5K catalogue)
